 "name_en": "Contract Accounting – Intelligent Collections (6WB)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Contract Accounting – Intelligent Collections (6WB)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiodd46728baca84583814ebeb615b3e48f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd46728baca84583814ebeb615b3e48f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Behavioral Insights allows organizations, such as government agencies and companies, to analyze the behavior of customers and to generate insights. It provides an expanded overview of events.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">In this scope item, you integrate with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> for Behavioral Insights and use Machine Learning techniques to improve the process for Dunning by Collection Strategy.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd46728baca84583814ebeb615b3e48f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute the prediction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute and Check Dunning Proposal run</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd46728baca84583814ebeb615b3e48f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">This enables the organization to perform efficient and reliable analysis of the customer, so that they can make decisions and take the necessary manual actions.</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>合同会计核算 - 智能收款 (6WB)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiodd46728baca84583814ebeb615b3e48f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd46728baca84583814ebeb615b3e48f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Behavioral Insights 允许组织（例如政府机构和公司）分析客户行为并生成洞察。它提供了事件的扩展概览。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">在此范围项目中，将 与面向 Behavioral Insights 的 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 集成，并使用机器学习技术改进按收款策略催款的流程。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd46728baca84583814ebeb615b3e48f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行预测</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行并检查催款建议运行</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiodd46728baca84583814ebeb615b3e48f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">这使组织能够对客户执行高效可靠的分析，以便他们可以做出决策并采取必要的手动操作。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
